WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.950
Which cloud?

2
00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:05.723
The records reach Entra ID through the
contractor source's own provisioning app,

3
00:00:05.723 --> 00:00:08.288
through the same middleware employees use.

4
00:00:08.288 --> 00:00:12.419
API-driven inbound provisioning
and access reviews are

5
00:00:12.419 --> 00:00:16.375
part of the commercial Entra
ID service, which GCC uses.

6
00:00:16.375 --> 00:00:18.932
The middleware accepts
only the Graph host,

7
00:00:18.932 --> 00:00:22.412
and the reconciliation reads
users from the cloud you name.

8
00:00:22.412 --> 00:00:23.640
There's no default.
